        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Morant Satin Nickel Keyed Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClassic design and easy installation of the Deltana Morant Satin Nickel Keyed Lever will not disappoint those looking for a simple leverset that will improve the look of any space.  It fits any standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. This leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of Deltana 6411-15 Entry Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install, this lever fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function is ANSI rated grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry function - 5 pin Kwikset compatible keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed, field reversible lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Morant Entry Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-6410-specifications.pdf?v=1704262175\" target=\"new\"><b>Morant Lever Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (5)  Left.\r\n</p>",
